[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888640980","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100581#issuecomment-2888640980","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100581","id":2888640980,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sLSnU","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T23:43:06Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T23:43:06Z","body":"Hi,\r\n\r\nReviewed with Saracen and we think this currently introduces additional UI jank without fully addressing the existing issues in the Animation Library dialog.\r\n\r\nHere is one example of a problem that I encountered when testing:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16ef1b3c-fd32-4d9c-a27f-6422e328b60f)\r\n\r\nIf we want to mimic the multiselect behavior of the scene tree, we should do the same thing where if you multi-select and then click an icon like delete, it only applies to the group of selected nodes if I choose it on one of the selected.\r\n\r\nThe other jank I saw when testing is when I select an entry, it prevents me from saving any of the other entries or the library itself, since everything now only shows Make Unique, and I have to go out of my way to ctrl-click deselect the entry to allow saving the animation library. If we fix the previous issue I noted, that might also solve this, since the non-selected rows will still show Save and everything.\r\n\r\nAlso this PR introduces a regression (I tested 4.4.1+this patch) where Make Unique folds the animation library up, which is not correct. against 4.4.1 which does not fold up when doing make unique.\r\n\r\nI also want to say maybe we should consider adding a global menu kind of like the animation editor has a Edit menu with all the options, and/or a context menu similar to the scene tree.\r\n\r\nOverall there are a lot of issues with the animation library issues, and it would benefit from an overall UI overhaul. I just want to make sure we don't make things worse.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888640980/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2960270381","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100581#issuecomment-2960270381","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100581","id":2960270381,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wciQt","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription